          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/e5acc4a2f5724c59be4123e97d98fa60_b01-de-donde-eres.mp3?Expires=1794099398&Signature=WWYdjC2RJ8fZMZoVImu8gYU5gQhIhUEewVJD5WinH2037PzHIQdU3KWjcG0qEuQVch5KfLMdpJL4PekVdd1s-ZDfLMgPliXuJTNfQMo8Ny8ofwTnYvobDeX9Zdhmy4ZrseND~itRtQ6M12mLZOC2INJcMlvY5vOyerjgqjtIhwSnBgbkGSIO~PCUZKwyojFuDp5FKsOHQ3WBxoCk9JXx8uFGaGuXKerxWnDZsRG1YpSeuyKJZ9Vu8Za2lYH67JogGTaov4TfS99bfnqdKREAy5iXX21s9d4GleZCFoiCVV0Ub~TEqdJfoBk0sNjOcbCYnmJQs7xPhAdDYS~vTjas-Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "35959376-e45f-42aa-9b78-de50add233a6",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Soy de México.</strong></p><p>Essa linha fecha com a resposta.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7caf53bc50d543de80cc711fac607b74_b05-soy-de-mexico.mp3?Expires=1794099398&Signature=C5HHvT~yNwZUwZiVdmRYEJZ10U2ZTK6~wETukHSAhdp9oFaAEwufjdBf9uzB~pq67q1dV9A3NzoY3vh6f7hDucrDcm0dJ385ogz91ll1ZYqE9dyUBEzceYtkD9Fg4Beo1tcmTJO5KaDP2yz9jGm6kWTz4kLCvKCaTAJuQdRBcQJNlQbTx8R0vBgSlM5uJkW2raDh2zfaKCBjNsRcWnW7SEAhXVJRLylehi5sr6ycm27ldId1rrCg~2~IxwH3IWNj1vXK4uKk98wwVbtHWlN5tu7L6JOKbF9fPY3xJPmsfngz5LCUHR7kN-dPDZ2nuyQKr04IK3Tcn7BiF6h6Jv2WkA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "0cbae343-3bc0-4578-9f12-de937bebb7f5",
          "textContent": "<p>Quando as duas linhas se juntam, a troca fica assim:</p><p><strong>¿De dónde eres?</strong></p><p><strong>Soy de México.</strong></p><p>A pergunta usa <strong>eres</strong> e a resposta usa <strong>soy</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
